You besiege the castle: send creeps out of the siege cart, up the road and over the bridge, to the gate. The defender builds towers as the fight goes on.
1, 2, 3: choose a creep: runner (quick, frail), brute (slow, strong), shield bearer (armored). Or click its name.
Space (or a click on Send): send one of the kind chosen, if your gold pays for it.
Get enough of them to the gate to win; when your gold is spent and none is left on the road, the siege has failed.
